# 21. DEADLINE AND CANCELLATION

AIOS must have one global request deadline.

Propagate cancellation to:

* AG-001
* agents
* coordination
* LLM
* tools

If the deadline expires:

```text
TIMED_OUT
```

must be returned.

If AbortSignal is triggered:

```text
CANCELLED
```

must be returned.

Ensure cleanup occurs through finally blocks.

No execution leases may remain open.

No dangling timers.

No uncontrolled retries after cancellation.

